---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="FAQs | McGill Math Seminar">
	<div class="container page-spacing">
		<header class="page-header">
			<h1 class="page-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
			<p class="page-subtitle">Everything you need to know before showing up to Burnside Hall.</p>
		</header>

		<div class="faq-stack">
			<div class="faq-card">
				<h3>Do I need to be a Math Major to attend?</h3>
				<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Absolutely not. The seminar is engineered for anyone interested in logical structures. If you can appreciate patterns, you will follow the discussions perfectly.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="faq-card">
				<h3>What does "Absolute Confusion" imply?</h3>
				<p><strong>Answer:</strong> We choose topics that push past simple calculus equations. Getting completely lost during a speaker's talk is a feature of the experience, not a flaw. We break down problems together afterwards.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="faq-card">
				<h3>Can I pitch a talk topic myself?</h3>
				<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, please! We love student speakers. Simply chat with Emily at the end of any session or pull us aside to pitch a sketch proposal.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="faq-card">
				<h3>Is there an entry fee or sign-up?</h3>
				<p><strong>Answer:</strong> No. Registration is entirely drop-in. Just follow the smells of hot tea and cookies to room GIC 512.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	.container {
		max-width: 800px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 0 2rem;
	}
	.page-spacing {
		padding: 5rem 0;
	}
	.page-header {
		text-align: center;
		margin-bottom: 4rem;
	}
	.page-title {
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-size: 3rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}
	.page-subtitle {
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
	}
	.faq-stack {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 2rem;
	}
	.faq-card {
		background-color: var(--bg-pure);
		border: 2px solid var(--border-ink);
		border-radius: 6px;
		padding: 2rem;
		box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px var(--border-ink);
	}
	.faq-card h3 {
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-size: 1.35rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
		color: var(--mcgill-red);
	}
	.faq-card p {
		line-height: 1.6;
		font-size: 1rem;
	}
</style>
